WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.010
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:06.520
Today, I am going to explain an episode called
“Arkange1” from the British science fiction

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.069
series “Black M1rror.”

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:09.417
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:10.868
Watch out and take care!

00:00:15.436 --> 00:00:18.539
The movie starts in a labor room of a hospital.

00:00:18.539 --> 00:00:24.060
Single mother, Marie Sambrell, lies on the
hospital bed, giving birth to her baby daughter,

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.060
Sara.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.650
She happily hugs her.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:27.980
Cut to three years later.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.990
Marie’s father, Russ, has been helping her
raising Sara.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.930
One morning, we see him trying to feed her
granddaughter.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.940
Marie comes in and offers to take Sara to
the park.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:41.640
As Sara plays, Marie is distracted talking
to someone else.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.940
Sometime later, she notices that her daughter
is missing.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.230
She calls for her but gets no reply.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.980
The screen goes blank.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.480
Then we see Marie continuing to cry and call
for her daughter in the street when a man

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.600
finds her.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.260
Apparently, she had followed a cat out of
the park.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.530
Marie hugs Sara in relief.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.640
A few days later, Marie takes her to a clinic.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.460
She has sign Sara up for a trial of a procedure
called Arkangel.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.700
The doctor invites them in, and quickly injects
Marie’s forehead with a chip.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:13.079
She then begins explaining to Marie the benefits
of the procedure.

00:01:13.079 --> 00:01:17.451
The chip just planted on Sara enables Marie
to monitor her through a tablet whenever she wants.

00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:22.530
She can have access to her location at all
times, monitor her vitals like blood pressure

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.760
and sugar levels, and also see whatever Sara
sees.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:30.399
The additional feature of the procedure includes
censoring violent or sexual content that wouldn’t

00:01:30.399 --> 00:01:31.969
be appropriate for a child.

00:01:31.969 --> 00:01:35.079
However, the procedure is irreversible.

00:01:35.079 --> 00:01:38.859
The doctor then changes the channel on the
TV to violent gunfire.

00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:43.289
She enables the ‘censoring’ feature, which
blurs the TV from Sara’s point of view.

00:01:43.289 --> 00:01:46.619
The same thing happens when Sara sees things
that scare her.

00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:51.179
At home, Russ is not happy about the procedure,
but Marie dismisses him.

00:01:51.179 --> 00:01:55.289
For the first few days, they have fun playing
hide and seek using the tablet.

00:01:55.289 --> 00:01:59.520
Marie always enables the censor when Sara
walks by the neighbor’s scary dog, so she

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:00.869
won’t be afraid.

00:02:00.869 --> 00:02:04.600
Ever since, Marie has been monitoring every
move Sara makes.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.890
One day when she is at work, the tablet starts
to beep because Sara’s cortisol level is

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.170
high, suggesting that she is stressed.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:14.700
Marie quickly checks it, and sees Ross having
a seizure.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.340
She runs to help her father and saves him.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.180
It is now six years later.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.830
Ross has passed away.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:24.070
Marie and Sara are the only ones living in
the house.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:26.750
That day, they pay a visit to Ross’s grave.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.110
Marie still always monitors Sara.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:33.360
As Marie cries grieving her father’s death,
her face is blurred to Sara, as it is parent

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:34.950
advisory content.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.530
Sara still cannot see the neighbour’s dog.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:42.070
She walks to her school where a group of her
friends watch violent videos on their tablet.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:44.590
Sara asks them to describe it to her.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:46.650
All of her friends know that she is special.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.830
One of them named Trick tries to explain the
video to her.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.590
When she asks him how blood looks like, he
describes it as red juice.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:58.470
The system also censors Trick’s cursing,
hence Sara only hears a muffled noise.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.970
That day at home, Sara draws a man bleeding
through his head.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:05.160
As she completes the drawing, the system blurs
the blood.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.810
Frustrated, she sharpens a pencil and stabs
her finger with it.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.980
As it starts to bleed, the system blurs it
too.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.740
She puts the blood on her face to at least
feel it.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:18.810
Just then, the tablet starts to beep, suggesting
that Sara is stressed.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:23.250
Marie quickly rushes to her room to see Sara
repeatedly stabbing her palm.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.280
The following day, she takes Sara to a therapist.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:30.529
He shows her a picture of two people fighting,
but Sara doesn’t recognize what they are doing.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:35.280
Marie assumes that she has autism, but the
doctor tells her that it is probably the result

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.460
of her whole life being censored.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:41.910
He then mentions that the Arkangel wasn’t
launched nationwide because of the same reason.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:46.500
Since the implant cannot be removed, he suggests
Marie get rid of the parental unit.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.230
Marie feels guilty for being the reason her
daughter is different.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:54.490
That day, she returns home and turns off all
the censor features of the tablet.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.670
She then hides it in the kitchen cabinet.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.550
She tells Sara about the system being off
during breakfast.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:04.890
However, Sara is a little skeptical because
she has never been without her mom’s supervision.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.060
She walks out and is startled to see the neighbor’s
dog bark at her for the first time.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.180
Scared, she tries to cross the road and is
almost hit by a car.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.900
She reaches school to see her friend, Trick,
fighting a boy.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.419
She can see his busted lips for the first
time.

00:04:19.419 --> 00:04:24.139
Trick is happy that she can finally see everything
and takes the opportunity to show her sexual

00:04:24.139 --> 00:04:25.860
contents and violent videos.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:30.849
The following day, Marie sees Sara off to
school, then keeps the tablet in the attic.

00:04:30.849 --> 00:04:34.770
Sara gets more accustomed to the neighbor’s
dog and quickly runs when she sees it.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.870
A lot of time passes.

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:41.419
Sara is now fifteen and is fully accustomed
to life without Marie’s supervision.

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:43.870
She even makes friends with the neighbor’s
dog.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:48.110
That day, she is with her friend, Meryl, at
school when they encounter Trick.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.840
He is all grown up now.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:52.080
Trick and Sara seem to like each other.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:55.030
He invites the girls to a bonfire beside the
lake.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:58.639
They accept the invitation and decide to lie
to their parents about going to a girl’s

00:04:58.639 --> 00:04:59.770
movie night.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.870
When Sara reaches home, she tells Marie the
same.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.889
She doesn’t question Sara further.

00:05:04.889 --> 00:05:08.340
In fact, Marie too is going out with her boyfriend
at night.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.600
The group of friends is now by the lake.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:14.000
As it turns out, Trick is a typical drug junkie
now.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.749
He passes Sara a blunt and she accepts it.

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:21.009
Meanwhile, Marie is back from her date and
calls Sara while returning home.

00:05:21.009 --> 00:05:23.830
However, the call directly goes to voice mail.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.749
Worried, she calls Sara’s friend; her mom
picks it up and informs her that the girls

00:05:27.749 --> 00:05:29.129
were never there.

00:05:29.129 --> 00:05:32.349
She calls her repeatedly, but Sara doesn’t
pick up.

00:05:32.349 --> 00:05:36.110
With no other choice left, she brings out
the tablet from the attic.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:40.219
She finally sees that Sara’s location is
beside a lake, two miles away.

00:05:40.219 --> 00:05:44.639
Marie then opens the cam and is horrified
to see her daughter having sex with Trick.

00:05:44.639 --> 00:05:46.880
She quickly turns the tablet off.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.689
Back at the lake, Sara and Trick chat while
making out.

00:05:49.689 --> 00:05:52.190
A knock on the door startles them.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:56.189
It is Meryl telling Sara that her mom has
found out about them sneaking out.

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.849
The girls then rush home in Trick’s van.

00:05:58.849 --> 00:06:02.460
When Sara is home, she apologizes to Marie
for being late.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.550
Marie doesn’t confront her either.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.370
The following day, Sara leaves for school.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.139
Marie brings the tablet to work with her that
day.

00:06:10.139 --> 00:06:14.710
Sara and Trick are together after school when
she asks him about the drugs he sells.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:18.630
Trick tells Sara that those are not for her,
but she insists on looking at one.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:23.350
Then, we see him trying to teach Sara how
people usually take drugs, but Sara insists

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.770
on trying some.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.710
Trick reluctantly agrees.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:31.020
Back home, the tablet starts to ring, suggesting
that Sara is stressed.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:34.360
Marie opens it again to see that it is a narcotic
alert.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.949
She is then horrified to see Sara snorting
coke.

00:06:36.949 --> 00:06:39.819
Marie loses her control and throws the tablet.

00:06:39.819 --> 00:06:44.699
She gets on her computer and uses reverse
search to find out Trick’s name and address.

00:06:44.699 --> 00:06:49.219
The following day, she goes to Trick’s job
and threatens him to stay away from Sara.

00:06:49.219 --> 00:06:51.939
She also shows him the footage of them having
sex.

00:06:51.939 --> 00:06:53.499
Trick is terrified.

00:06:53.499 --> 00:06:57.129
That night, he gets several calls from Sara,
but doesn’t pick them.

00:06:57.129 --> 00:06:58.940
Sara is distressed.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:03.344
The following night, as Sara texts Trick to
talk to her, Marie watches everything from the tablet.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.029
The next day, she goes to confront Trick.

00:07:07.029 --> 00:07:10.550
Because of fear of her mother, he tells her
that he doesn’t want her anymore.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.370
Marie again watches everything unfold from
the tablet.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:18.050
At breakfast, she crushes a birth control
pill and puts it in Sara’s smoothie.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:21.990
Sara doesn’t feel good the whole day and
even runs out of the class to vomit.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:25.539
She goes to the doctor later who tells her
that the vomiting is because of an emergency

00:07:25.539 --> 00:07:27.169
contraception pill.

00:07:27.169 --> 00:07:31.099
Sara is shocked and realizes that her mother
gave her the pill because she had only had

00:07:31.099 --> 00:07:33.159
a glass of smoothie that day.

00:07:33.159 --> 00:07:37.090
She rushes home and goes through the kitchen
cabinets, but doesn’t find anything.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:41.729
Then, she looks through the bin, and finds
an empty box of contraceptive pills.

00:07:41.729 --> 00:07:45.719
She runs to her mom’s room and finds the
tablet behind her pillow.

00:07:45.719 --> 00:07:50.240
Looking through it, she finally realizes that
Marie has been monitoring her all along.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.749
Hurt by her mother’s betrayal and invasion
of her privacy, she decides to run away.

00:07:54.749 --> 00:07:57.379
Sara quickly packs all her belongings.

00:07:57.379 --> 00:07:59.569
But just then, Marie arrives at the house.

00:07:59.569 --> 00:08:04.009
She finds the trashed kitchen and goes to
her room to see that Sara has found the tablet.

00:08:04.009 --> 00:08:06.319
When she opens it, Marie sees herself.

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:08.470
Sara is standing behind her.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:12.280
Agitated, she snatches the tablet from her
and tries to close it.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.900
But she mistakenly turns the censor on.

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:18.960
While in a fight, she hits her mother with
the tablet several times, not seeing the damage

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.449
she is causing.

00:08:20.449 --> 00:08:24.720
When the filter turns off, she sees Marie
with several cuts and bruises lying unconscious

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.039
on the floor.

00:08:26.039 --> 00:08:28.870
She quickly takes her bags and runs away.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:33.490
Sometime later, we see an injured Marie gain
consciousness and run to look for Sara.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.860
She goes out to the street and cries calling
for her daughter as she did at the beginning

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.159
of the movie.

00:08:38.159 --> 00:08:41.940
She still tries to use the tablet to look
for her, but it is destroyed.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:45.380
The movie ends as we see Sara hitchhike into
a truck.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:49.209
